Dialogue: 0,0:02:37.47,0:02:40.68,OP_JP,,0,0,0,,{\fad(480,480)\blur20\bord2\1a&HFF&}決して忘れはしないように
Dialogue: 0,0:02:40.91,0:02:43.89,OP_JP,,0,0,0,,{\fad(160,0)\blur20\bord2\1a&HFF&}明日　きみと生きれるなら
Dialogue: 0,0:02:43.89,0:02:47.02,OP_JP,,0,0,0,,{\blur20\bord2\1a&HFF&}明日　きみと話せるなら
Dialogue: 0,0:02:47.02,0:02:50.02,OP_JP,,0,0,0,,{\blur20\bord2\1a&HFF&}明日　きみと笑えるなら
Dialogue: 0,0:02:50.02,0:02:53.15,OP_JP,,0,0,0,,{\blur20\bord2\1a&HFF&}って思える　きみと出会えた
Dialogue: 0,0:02:53.15,0:02:59.57,OP_JP,,0,0,0,,{\blur20\bord2\1a&HFF&}僕は　僕は　きっと　幸せものだ
Dialogue: 0,0:02:59.57,0:03:06.48,OP_JP,,0,0,0,,{\fad(0,160)\blur20\bord2\1a&HFF&}僕は　僕は　幸せものだ
Dialogue: 5,0:22:21.57,0:22:27.62,ED_JP,,0,0,40,,{\fad(240,240)\an8\blur5}Everything melts into the dead of night
Dialogue: 5,0:22:27.62,0:22:32.87,ED_JP,,0,700,0,,{\fad(240,240)\blur5}As if even gravity fades away
Dialogue: 5,0:22:33.63,0:22:39.13,ED_JP,,700,0,0,,{\fad(240,240)\blur5}Enchanted by the smile like a spark
Dialogue: 5,0:22:39.13,0:22:43.68,ED_JP,,700,0,0,,{\fad(240,240)\blur5}「寂しい」忘れちゃう夜だ
Dialogue: 5,0:22:45.89,0:22:52.14,ED_JP,,0,0,0,,{\fad(240,240)\blur5}くだらなく愛おしい話を聞かせて
Dialogue: 5,0:22:52.73,0:22:54.56,ED_JP,,0,0,0,,{\fad(240,240)\blur5}Dance with me？
Dialogue: 5,0:22:54.56,0:22:58.73,ED_JP,,0,0,0,,{\fad(240,240)\blur5}二人で無限の闇を
Dialogue: 5,0:22:58.73,0:23:04.53,ED_JP,,0,0,40,,{\fad(240,240)\blur5}重ねた　手のひら　ぎゅっと結んで
Dialogue: 5,0:23:04.53,0:23:10.70,ED_JP,,0,0,0,,{\fad(240,240)\blur5}ぼやけた視界に映ったものは
Dialogue: 5,0:23:10.70,0:23:16.75,ED_JP,,0,0,20,,{\fad(240,240)\blur5}悲しいくらいに　美しいんだね
Dialogue: 5,0:23:16.75,0:23:20.88,ED_JP,,0,0,0,,{\fad(240,240)\blur5}彼方明けゆく空
Dialogue: 5,0:23:21.63,0:23:25.39,ED_JP,,0,0,0,,{\fad(240,240)\blur5}目を逸らすんだ
Dialogue: 5,0:23:31.64,0:23:38.52,ED_JP,,0,0,0,,{\fad(240,240)\blur5}Stay in night
